comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-26T17:09:34.752Z","harness:claude-code","Live confirmation 2026-07-26 from a 37,202-entry census of the whole history corpus: no entry carries any key matching effort or thinking, while CLAUDE_EFFORT is set to xhigh in this very process. That is the descriptor-shape half of this item measured end to end rather than inferred from the source. The same census shows 0 entries with a session value even though the detector resolves one, which is the sub-agent lineage half. Recording here because the numbers separate the two failures cleanly: pm-0zcwz6 is a wrong key list against an existing field, this item is the absence of any field at all."
  "2026-07-27T06:22:58.680Z","harness:codex","Final local evidence 2026-07-27: tracker-linked tests pass for every item; CI=1 pnpm lint passes ESLint, zero jscpd clones, static quality, 100% docstrings, package boundary, token budget, SDK surface/import-cost/transport ratchets; 377 files and 6,448 tests pass at exact 100% statements/branches/functions/lines. Fresh packed acceptance passed npx, Bun SDK import, bunx, an unrelated npm prefix with resolved executable containment, 86-action SDK/CLI completeness with zero unclassified inputs, three provenance dimensions, durable CLI model/effort/role history, and the 88-command package-first dogfood flow. TOON 4.1 passed a 2,127-item storage integrity read, the earlier 2,125-item read/serialize/read corpus sweep, 250-run adversarial properties, and fail-closed negative controls. Secret scan, pnpm audit, GitHub Dependabot/code/secret scanning, open PR inventory, and open-issue PM-link inventory are all clean; only canonically deferred incompatible Sentry, npm-package-arg, and TypeScript upgrades remain. Live pm validate reports zero history drift, zero storage failures, and only the existing 290 historical resolution warnings; pm health is healthy with real-time telemetry draining."
